{"D:\\wt\\lou3\\vlog\\lou3\\voz\\b011_t4.wav": {"text": "Scrape it, wipe it, a few drops of oil, and back on the burner for a minute. The more burgers you make in it, the better the next one comes out. That's how a diner griddle gets black and shiny over 50 years. Now, if it goes wrong, here's why. If it sticks and tears when you flip, your pan wasn't hot enough, or your spatula is dull, give the pan more time and scrape harder. If the burger falls apart when you smash it, the meat was too warm or too lean, keep it in the ice box until the last second and by the 80-20. If it comes out dry, you smashed it late or you pressed it after the flip, smash in the first 30 seconds, then hands off. if your kitchen fills with smoke wipe the extra fat out with a paper towel held in tongs between batches and about safety the government says ground beef should reach one hundred and sixty degrees", "words": [{"w": " Scrape", "s": 0.02, "e": 0.46}, {"w": " it,", "s": 0.46, "e": 1.06}, {"w": " wipe", "s": 1.06, "e": 1.22}, {"w": " it,", "s": 1.22, "e": 1.88}, {"w": " a", "s": 1.88, "e": 2.02}, {"w": " few", "s": 2.02, "e": 2.3}, {"w": " drops", "s": 2.3, "e": 2.74}, {"w": " of", "s": 2.74, "e": 2.94}, {"w": " oil,", "s": 2.94, "e": 3.82}, {"w": " and", "s": 3.82, "e": 3.88}, {"w": " back", "s": 3.88, "e": 4.32}, {"w": " on", "s": 4.32, "e": 4.52}, {"w": " the", "s": 4.52, "e": 4.66}, {"w": " burner", "s": 4.66, "e": 5.04}, {"w": " for", "s": 5.04, "e": 5.3}, {"w": " a", "s": 5.3, "e": 5.46}, {"w": " minute.", "s": 5.46, "e": 6.22}, {"w": " The", "s": 6.6, "e": 6.72}, {"w": " more", "s": 6.72, "e": 7.02}, {"w": " burgers", "s": 7.02, "e": 7.42}, {"w": " you", "s": 7.42, "e": 7.58}, {"w": " make", "s": 7.58, "e": 7.92}, {"w": " in", "s": 7.92, "e": 8.08}, {"w": " it,", "s": 8.08, "e": 8.24}, {"w": " the", "s": 8.24, "e": 8.56}, {"w": " better", "s": 8.56, "e": 8.96}, {"w": " the", "s": 8.96, "e": 9.12}, {"w": " next", "s": 9.12, "e": 9.44}, {"w": " one", "s": 9.44, "e": 9.72}, {"w": "